{
  "id": "scenario-03",
  "title": "Scenario 3 - GL and Workers Comp for Subcontractor",
  "formType": "acord-25",
  "summary": "Apex Roofing emails about a reroofing job for a general contractor. Their office manager isn't sure about one detail on the workers comp policy — the agency file has the answer.",
  "instructions": [
    "Read the email from Apex Roofing. When the sender is unsure about a policy detail, trust the agency file below, not their guess.",
    "Complete General Liability and Workers Compensation using the policy file exactly as written.",
    "Use the exact remark wording required for the general contractor in the description of operations box.",
    "Leave Automobile Liability and Umbrella/Excess blank — there is no file for those coverages on this account.",
    "A perfect score is required to unlock the next scenario."
  ],
  "request": [
    {
      "label": "Date",
      "lines": [
        "04/29/2026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Client Email",
      "lines": [
        "From: Dana Osei, Office Manager, Apex Roofing & Sheet Metal, LLC <dana@apexroofingfl.com>",
        "To: certificates@lavatraining.com",
        "Subject: COI needed for ABC General Contractors — Naples reroofing job",
        "Hi Ana,",
        "We start the reroofing job for ABC General Contractors at 550 Harbor Point Rd in Naples next week and their risk management office needs a certificate before our crew can badge in.",
        "The contract requires them as additional insured on our GL with a waiver of subrogation, and they also want to see our workers comp info since we'll have several crew on the roof.",
        "ABC General Contractors, Inc. is additional insured for ongoing operations. Waiver of subrogation applies where required by written contract for reroofing project at 550 Harbor Point Rd, Naples, FL.",
        "One more thing — our owner, Ray, thought he's still listed as excluded from the work comp policy from back when it was just him and one helper, but I think that changed when we added the new roofing crew this year. Can you double check that against the policy on file before you send this out?",
        "Thanks,",
        "Dana"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Certificate Holder / Requestor",
      "lines": [
        "ABC General Contractors, Inc.",
        "Attn: Risk Management",
        "550 Harbor Point Rd",
        "Naples, FL 34102"
